1
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:36,560
I know.

2
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:38,520
Truth is, you don't believe at all

3
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:39,840
that the final battle location

4
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:41,880
will be at Sea Breeze Pass.

5
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:46,160
But I have no evidence

6
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:47,440
to prove my theory.

7
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:50,520
So this time, you chose to stay silent?

8
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:51,360
No.

9
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:54,280
I chose to partly trust the leadership,

10
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:55,840
and partly

11
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,080
to wait for the unexpected.

12
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:05,080
Report!

13
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:06,320
Battalion Commander,

14
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,920
Yang Maolin has been notified.

15
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:09,560
From now on, the Special Ops Team's

16
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:11,520
core mission is to find Wu Dazhou.

17
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:14,320
Where is the 1st Combat Team now?

18
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,640
At Dingge Chemical Fertilizer Plant.

19
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:17,320
They are meeting up with Battalion Commander Jiang Shengqiang

20
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:18,840
to lay siege to Sea Breeze Pass together.

21
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:19,840
Order

22
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,680
the 1st Combat Team to stand by.

23
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,880
Also, brief Commander Jiang on the situation.

24
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:24,520
Yes, sir!

25
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:27,320
Report the current location of the Air Assault Team.

26
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,240
Yes, sir!

27
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:31,520
Report!

28
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:34,440
Three Z-10s and three transport helicopters

29
00:02:34,440 --> 00:02:36,760
are parked at our pre-designated location,

30
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,400
the former Dingge Middle School playground.

31
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:44,800
That location is too dangerous.

32
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:48,800
Staff Officer Hu!

33
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,240
Here, sir!

34
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:51,720
Order the Air Assault Team's three transports

35
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:53,320
to relocate to Dingge Chemical Fertilizer Plant.

36
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:54,680
Have them meet up with the 1st Battle Group

37
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:56,280
and then camouflage themselves.

38
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,760
We can't put all our eggs in one basket.

39
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:00,760
Yes, sir!

40
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:05,880
Air Assault Detachment!

41
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:06,800
Air Assault Detachment!

42
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,520
Relocate your three transport helicopters

43
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:10,240
to Dingge Town Chemical Fertilizer Plant!

44
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:11,800
Three transport helicopters...

45
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:13,320
Even though I trust your intuition,

46
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,640
I have to remind you

47
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:17,680
that all our intel sources

48
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:19,960
are still firmly locked on Sea Breeze Pass.

49
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:21,720
Since when did you

50
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:23,240
start trusting my intuition too?

51
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,880
What about your data?

52
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,400
Trusting your intuition

53
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:28,520
is also a conclusion I reached

54
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,360
after multiple data analyses.

55
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:34,400
I've said this many times.

56
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:36,480
At times like this,

57
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:40,160
I don't want you to be the one supporting me.

58
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:43,040
Because only your doubts and opposition

59
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:45,360
can make me think more thoroughly.

60
00:03:50,040 --> 00:03:50,720
Alright then,

61
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:52,720
Battalion Commander Guo.

62
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:54,920
If our final battle location

63
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:56,360
really is at Sea Breeze Pass,

64
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:58,240
then our Wind Rider Battalion

65
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:00,520
will only have two combat teams on site.

66
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,120
Isn't that a bit...

67
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,480
Isn't that a bit less than perfect?

68
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:13,000
If it really is at Sea Breeze Pass,

69
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:15,640
as long as victory belongs to the 396th Brigade,

70
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,480
success doesn't have to be credited to me.

71
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,040
As we can see from the satellite map,

72
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:30,600
the Red Army's firepower and troops from all directions

73
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:32,520
are converging towards Sea Breeze Pass.

74
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,360
Meanwhile, according to our intel reconnaissance

75
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,600
and integrated platform detection,

76
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,360
the suspected command post of the 396th Brigade,

77
00:04:37,440 --> 00:04:39,360
and at least two battalion-level command posts,

78
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,200
along with relevant information warfare units,

79
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:43,080
are all moving towards Sea Breeze Pass.

80
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,480
Based on the current situation,

81
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,880
the encirclement is basically formed.

82
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,560
Excellent.

83
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,440
The battlefield for the final showdown is now set.

84
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,200
The nearby villagers have all relocated,

85
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:57,200
leaving only houses that haven't been demolished yet.

86
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:00,360
We can expect this urban combat to be intense.

87
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:03,840
Intense is good.

88
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,360
It'll be fun.

89
00:05:05,960 --> 00:05:06,880
If it's not intense,

90
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,520
it won't feel like a final showdown.

91
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:09,080
Yes, sir.

92
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,360
Report!

93
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:11,720
Come in.

94
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:15,440
Reporting, Brigade Commander.

95
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:16,520
The Red Army's vanguard units,

96
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:17,840
supported by artillery fire,

97
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:19,640
have launched a frontal attack against us.

98
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:21,640
They are assembling on the north and south flanks.

99
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:22,840
Good.

100
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,360
According to the original plan,

101
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,320
commit all our forces.

102
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,680
The more men they send, the better.

103
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:31,600
Yes, sir.

104
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:42,600
Xu Lingjun

105
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:45,000
Guo Zijian

106
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:47,440
Jiang Shengqiang

107
00:05:49,760 --> 00:05:50,360
Bring it on.

108
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:52,240
Come at me, all of you!

109
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,680
Let me show you

110
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:57,120
the secret weapon I, Di Yunfeng, kept hidden,

111
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,240
and just how powerful it really is.

112
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,000
Fall back!

113
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,080
I'll cover you!

114
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:53,960
I never expected

115
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,720
that in an army like ours, which hasn't

116
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:59,040
seen a real war in nearly 40 years,

117
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:00,920
we'd have soldiers like this,

118
00:08:01,880 --> 00:08:02,920
with this kind of tactical awareness.

119
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:03,880
Indeed.

120
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,120
Even though we've now entered

121
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,600
the era of information warfare,

122
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,280
our infantry

123
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:09,480
remains a force

124
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,720
with tenacious combat capabilities.

125
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,400
True.

126
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,240
We have never

127
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:16,200
lived in a peaceful era,

128
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:18,600
we just live in a peaceful country.

129
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:21,600
We don't hope for war,

130
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,080
but we must always

131
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:25,320
be prepared to defend our country.

132
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:27,960
With Chinese soldiers like these,

133
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,640
we are invincible.

134
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:30,760
Indeed.

135
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:33,080
With a Chinese military like this,

136
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:35,120
I feel incredibly proud.

137
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:37,840
What brings you here?

138
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:41,200
I came to see if you needed anything.

139
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,320
We don't need a thing.

140
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:44,200
We just want to see how this battle unfolds.

141
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,520
The frontal assault is led

142
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,720
by two teams from the Wind Rider Battalion.

143
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:52,600
To the north

144
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,840
are the personnel we temporarily rallied,

145
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:55,640
who are currently en route.

146
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:57,600
To the south is Jiang Shengqiang's unit,

147
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,880
which should also arrive soon.

148
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,440
To the east is the ocean.

149
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:04,640
We wouldn't force Di Yunfeng into the sea, would we?

150
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,120
Report!

151
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:08,160
Hurricane Battalion is engaging the Blue Force in the south.

152
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:12,200
At this rate,

153
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,640
before lunch,

154
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,040
the battle should be over.

155
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:18,200
If Di Yunfeng isn't hiding any backup,

156
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,520
that's a fair assessment.

157
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:22,000
It's been such a fierce battle,

158
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:24,040
and the Blue Force even sent their Guards to the front.

159
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,720
They shouldn't have any backup left.

160
00:09:26,280 --> 00:09:27,080
True, Brigade Commander.

161
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:29,000
I think we'll be able to

162
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:31,040
reap the fruits of victory very soon.

163
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:43,040
Yihu,

164
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,920
notify all personnel in the Special Ops Platoon

165
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,120
to withdraw from combat immediately.

166
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:46,880
Platoon Leader,

167
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:48,240
we're on a roll. Why withdraw?

168
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:50,240
Right now, we only have one mission.

169
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,720
And that's to find the Blue Army Special Ops.

170
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:54,640
Judging by their equipment and skills,

171
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:56,040
they aren't Special Ops at all.

172
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,160
They got off easy.

173
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:57,760
Pass the order.

174
00:10:58,040 --> 00:10:59,560
Assemble at Dingge Chemical Fertilizer Plant.

175
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:00,120
Yes, sir.

176
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:02,440
All Special Ops Platoon members, listen up!

177
00:11:02,560 --> 00:11:03,360
Withdraw immediately!

178
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:04,640
Assemble at Dingge Chemical Fertilizer Plant.

179
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:05,160
Yes, sir!

180
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:21,800
Brigade Commander, we've verified it.

181
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:24,160
The enemy at our front is a Wind Rider Battalion team.

182
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:25,920
Firepower is heavy, and the urban combat is intense.

183
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:27,840
The other two routes of Red Army combat vehicles

184
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:29,640
are less than a twenty-minute drive from Sea Breeze Pass.

185
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:33,640
Have all the targets been fully identified?

186
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:34,280
At present,

187
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:36,680
the fixed target points for the Red Army's combat units

188
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:37,760
have been largely confirmed.

189
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:41,160
However, a few special vehicles just withdrew from the battlefield.

190
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:45,600
In this direction.

191
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,160
Correct.

192
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:55,080
Activate the third set of ciphers.

193
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:56,440
Pass on my orders.

194
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:58,200
Activate the reserves immediately.

195
00:11:58,560 --> 00:11:59,040
Yes, sir.

196
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,040
Zoom in on this area for me.

197
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:07,680
Battalion Commander!

198
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:08,920
A message from the Wind Rider Battalion.

199
00:12:09,280 --> 00:12:11,720
Originally scheduled to attack Sea Breeze Pass with us,

200
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:12,960
the Wind Rider Battalion's first team

201
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,320
has temporarily changed their plans.

202
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,280
They're staying behind at the fertilizer plant.

203
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:23,040
Staying behind at the fertilizer plant?

204
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:34,120
Wu Dazhou's special ops team suddenly vanished into thin air.

205
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:38,880
It makes sense for Guo Zijian to hold something back.

206
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,800
Since Guo Zijian is giving the chance for major merit

207
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:42,640
to us,

208
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:44,160
we shouldn't hold back either.

209
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:46,480
I suggest we set off immediately

210
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:48,000
and head straight for the Blue Army's command center

211
00:12:48,040 --> 00:12:49,520
to be the first to capture Di Yunfeng.

212
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:52,560
Di Yunfeng won't be caught so easily.

213
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:54,760
He's already been pushed to a dead end.

214
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:57,400
Who knows what ruthless moves he might pull.

215
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:03,640
Are we just going to let someone else take the credit?

216
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:05,160
No.

217
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:07,160
Orders!

218
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:10,120
Advance at full speed toward Di Yunfeng's command post!

219
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:11,840
But the battalion command and emergency squad

220
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:13,040
must keep their distance from the main force.

221
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:14,560
Yes, sir! I'll relay it immediately.

222
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:20,080
All companies, attention!

223
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:21,080
All companies, attention!

224
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:22,240
Advance at full speed!

225
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:23,240
Advance at full speed!

226
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:33,760
Loitering munitions are ready for launch.

227
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,640
Targets have been confirmed.

228
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:37,360
Have we missed any targets?

229
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:40,920
As for the combat equipment of the 396th Brigade,

230
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:42,120
we have a 3D view of all of it.

231
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:43,360
No matter from which angle,

232
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:45,200
we can quickly confirm them through the BeiDou System.

233
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:48,480
Listen to my command.

234
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:52,160
Aside from the combat equipment currently engaging our forces,

235
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:53,320
all remaining firepower

236
00:13:53,760 --> 00:13:55,440
will strike the Red Army's combat vehicles with full force.

237
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:02,920
Loitering munitions!

238
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:05,400
Former Battalion Commander,

239
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:06,680
you're in for a treat.

240
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:09,000
This is the Army's new gadget.

241
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,120
It has a very high clearance level.

242
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:12,520
I didn't expect it to be used in this exercise.

243
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,360
The 396th Brigade gets quite the special treatment.

244
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:15,640
Dad,

245
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,960
is there something special about this missile?

246
00:14:18,280 --> 00:14:19,520
Why are you so excited?

247
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:23,080
It's an integrated recon-strike suicide drone missile.

248
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:24,840
Isn't that still just a missile?

249
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:25,280
No.

250
00:14:25,520 --> 00:14:26,920
It's not an ordinary missile.

251
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:29,240
Missiles don't loiter in the air.

252
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:30,400
But drones do.

253
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:33,800
Once missiles and drones are seamlessly integrated,

254
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:36,080
it becomes a weapon capable of changing

255
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:38,360
the Army's mode of combat.

256
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:40,520
Former Battalion Commander,

257
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:43,200
you've researched new weapons quite a bit.

258
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:47,160
I was also inspired at an airshow.

259
00:14:47,760 --> 00:14:50,440
Then I immediately contacted relevant experts.

260
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:52,280
I found out they were already deeply involved

261
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:53,720
in this field.

262
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:55,840
It's just that due to various reasons,

263
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:58,920
there hasn't been a greater investment in production.

264
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:00,960
But you saw a business opportunity.

265
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:02,800
Business opportunities are one thing,

266
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:04,640
tactical advantage is another.

267
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:06,200
Indeed.

268
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:07,600
Former Battalion Commander,

269
00:15:07,680 --> 00:15:09,480
you have such a sharp eye.

270
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:11,240
I believe this loitering munition,

271
00:15:11,680 --> 00:15:13,080
even if it's not your product,

272
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:16,000
has your hard work poured into it.

273
00:15:21,560 --> 00:15:22,120
Look!

274
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:25,160
The loitering munition is about to show its power.

275
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:26,280
Strike initiated.

276
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:17,920
Report.

277
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:19,080
Speak.

278
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:20,720
The Blue Force is transmitting signals,

279
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:21,960
but we can't decrypt them yet.

280
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:25,120
It is worth noting that

281
00:16:25,600 --> 00:16:27,360
this cipher is being used for the first time today.

282
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:31,120
What I feared has finally happened.

283
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:33,880
Notify the brigade command post to relocate immediately.

284
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:35,600
Order Yang Maolin and Zeng Muhan

285
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:37,560
to prepare for the highest level of defense.

286
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:38,440
Yes, sir.

287
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:56,480
Brigade Commander.

288
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:58,200
The Red forces on the perimeter are mostly cleared,

289
00:16:58,200 --> 00:16:59,760
but the Red forces engaged with us

290
00:16:59,960 --> 00:17:01,000
are closing in too fast.

291
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:02,360
We can't hold them off.

292
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:04,800
Xu Lingjun

293
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:07,280
hasn't left yet, has he?

294
00:17:07,560 --> 00:17:08,280
Of course not.

295
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:10,560
He's waiting to take you prisoner.

296
00:17:15,520 --> 00:17:16,320
Order:

297
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:19,760
Target our command post

298
00:17:21,800 --> 00:17:22,760
and blanket the area with artillery.

299
00:17:24,480 --> 00:17:25,040
Brigade Commander,

300
00:17:25,280 --> 00:17:26,800
wouldn't that mean we'd be killed in action?

301
00:17:37,800 --> 00:17:39,080
You're right.

302
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,600
Then we'll be killed in action.

303
00:17:44,800 --> 00:17:46,360
But I actually think

304
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:48,600
going out like this

305
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:52,000
is truly glorious.

306
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:53,200
Glorious.

307
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:57,440
Relay my orders.

308
00:17:58,160 --> 00:17:59,960
Order all Blue Force personnel

309
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:01,760
to shout in unison,

310
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:05,000
"Fire on my position!"

311
00:18:15,560 --> 00:18:16,160
Comrades,

312
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:18,960
we

313
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:21,680
must let this Xu Lingjun know

314
00:18:22,280 --> 00:18:23,720
how he died.

315
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:24,880
Right?

316
00:18:25,120 --> 00:18:26,280
Yes!

317
00:18:35,320 --> 00:18:39,360
Fire on my position! Fire on my position!

318
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:41,120
Fire on my position! Fire on my position!

319
00:18:41,120 --> 00:18:44,400
Fire on my position! Fire on my position!

320
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:53,800
Fire on my position! Fire on my position!

321
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:55,160
Fire on my position!

322
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:56,960
Fire on my position! Fire on my position!

323
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:02,000
Report!

324
00:19:02,160 --> 00:19:03,880
Liang Hong from Wind Rider Battalion sent an urgent wire.

325
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:05,320
Advising brigade command to relocate immediately.

326
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:06,520
Report!

327
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:08,720
Drone unit from Wind Rider Battalion reports...

328
00:19:08,760 --> 00:19:09,920
Our two advancing columns

329
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:11,960
were struck by Blue Army loitering munitions and missiles.

330
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:13,600
All equipment has been destroyed.

331
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:14,800
Loitering munitions?

332
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:16,080
Oh no.

333
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:18,280
Di Yunfeng wants to take us down with him!

334
00:19:20,120 --> 00:19:21,680
Relocate immediately! Relocate immediately!

335
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:29,040
It's too late.

336
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:37,160
This Di Yunfeng...

337
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:41,080
tough to fight, relentless, and unpredictable.

338
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:44,360
For the battles ahead,

339
00:19:46,320 --> 00:19:47,720
we can only rely on Guo Zijian

340
00:19:48,520 --> 00:19:49,600
and that half a battalion of his.

341
00:19:52,720 --> 00:19:53,560
There's still a chance.

342
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:58,760
It's been verified.

343
00:19:59,280 --> 00:20:00,200
The Blue Army's reserve force

344
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:02,040
is a full long-range rocket artillery battalion,

345
00:20:02,040 --> 00:20:04,080
and a loitering munition launch unit.

346
00:20:04,840 --> 00:20:06,680
Our drones have locked onto their position.

347
00:20:08,360 --> 00:20:09,600
Such a massive move.

348
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:12,240
In this strike,

349
00:20:12,240 --> 00:20:14,160
we lost two entire combat teams

350
00:20:14,400 --> 00:20:15,680
and three Z-10s.

351
00:20:15,680 --> 00:20:16,880
What a terrible shame.

352
00:20:17,800 --> 00:20:18,960
If it weren't for you

353
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:20,120
relocating those

354
00:20:20,120 --> 00:20:21,960
three transport helicopters in time,

355
00:20:22,320 --> 00:20:24,440
our air assault unit would be completely wiped out.

356
00:20:26,480 --> 00:20:27,840
That's not the main issue.

357
00:20:28,200 --> 00:20:30,040
What matters is whether the Blue Army's reserve

358
00:20:30,040 --> 00:20:32,400
only consists of this one long-range rocket battalion.

359
00:20:32,800 --> 00:20:34,960
Since they can play the mutual destruction card,

360
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:35,800
it means

361
00:20:35,800 --> 00:20:37,960
they hold more than just these cards in their hands.

362
00:20:38,080 --> 00:20:38,920
So right now,

363
00:20:38,960 --> 00:20:40,880
we need to wait for orders from the Directorate.

364
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:41,760
If, after we

365
00:20:41,760 --> 00:20:43,560
strike the Blue Army's long-range artillery,

366
00:20:43,600 --> 00:20:44,640
the exercise ends,

367
00:20:44,920 --> 00:20:46,440
it means Di Yunfeng

368
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:50,080
orchestrated a final act of mutual destruction.

369
00:20:50,200 --> 00:20:50,880
That's right.

370
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:52,720
If the Directorate orders

371
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:53,920
that the battle continues,

372
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:55,800
then we must find the enemy as quickly as possible.

373
00:20:55,800 --> 00:20:57,720
Or be found by them first.

374
00:20:59,360 --> 00:21:00,320
Exactly.

375
00:21:13,800 --> 00:21:14,480
Chief.

376
00:21:15,080 --> 00:21:16,000
I'm totally convinced.

377
00:21:16,840 --> 00:21:17,720
Your deduction of "the mantis stalks the cicada,

378
00:21:17,720 --> 00:21:19,240
unaware of the oriole behind"

379
00:21:19,600 --> 00:21:20,560
was absolutely spot on.

380
00:21:23,920 --> 00:21:24,800
Then tell me,

381
00:21:25,400 --> 00:21:26,400
how was it spot on?

382
00:21:26,680 --> 00:21:27,360
It's obvious.

383
00:21:28,080 --> 00:21:29,680
Di Yunfeng actively played the cicada,

384
00:21:30,120 --> 00:21:32,320
to lure Xu Lingjun into being the mantis.

385
00:21:32,800 --> 00:21:34,560
Little did we know, Di Yunfeng had a backup plan.

386
00:21:34,840 --> 00:21:35,720
At the critical moment,

387
00:21:35,800 --> 00:21:37,200
one signal flare in the sky,

388
00:21:37,200 --> 00:21:38,960
summons an army to his aid.

389
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:40,360
Looking at it this way,

390
00:21:40,520 --> 00:21:42,800
the long-range rocket battalion must be his backup.

391
00:21:42,800 --> 00:21:43,800
However,

392
00:21:44,120 --> 00:21:45,480
what they didn't expect was that

393
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:47,880
the Red Force still had the last laugh.

394
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:56,800
Why would you draw that conclusion?

395
00:21:58,120 --> 00:21:59,680
Guo Zijian still has a slingshot in his hand.

396
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:00,840
Look,

397
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:02,560
the drones

398
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:04,640
have wiped out the artillery positions.

399
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:11,240
For your deduction,

400
00:22:12,160 --> 00:22:13,920
if a perfect score is ten,

401
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:15,280
you'd get at most

402
00:22:16,320 --> 00:22:17,400
a six.

403
00:22:18,280 --> 00:22:19,120
Chief,

404
00:22:19,840 --> 00:22:21,680
the exercise is about to end soon.

405
00:22:22,640 --> 00:22:24,920
Do you still have another slingshot in your hand?

406
00:22:25,520 --> 00:22:26,360
Director Liu,

407
00:22:27,080 --> 00:22:28,520
let me remind you.

408
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:30,120
Think about it,

409
00:22:30,640 --> 00:22:32,840
where did the Blue Force's special ops team go?

410
00:22:39,960 --> 00:22:40,840
This battle...

411
00:22:42,440 --> 00:22:43,440
is really frustrating.

412
00:22:44,920 --> 00:22:45,520
Battalion Commander,

413
00:22:46,120 --> 00:22:47,320
good thing you reacted fast.

414
00:22:47,840 --> 00:22:49,720
At least the battalion command post was saved.

415
00:22:50,320 --> 00:22:51,320
What's the point?

416
00:22:51,960 --> 00:22:53,640
We only have one emergency response squad left.

417
00:22:54,400 --> 00:22:55,560
Don't be too frustrated.

418
00:22:56,160 --> 00:22:56,960
They just banked on

419
00:22:56,960 --> 00:22:58,480
the value of being taken prisoner personally

420
00:22:58,760 --> 00:22:59,560
to lure us in.

421
00:22:59,800 --> 00:23:01,000
They wanted to wipe us out all at once.

422
00:23:01,480 --> 00:23:02,280
Our Brigade Commander...

423
00:23:02,560 --> 00:23:03,320
is so astute,

424
00:23:04,040 --> 00:23:05,160
but even he got carried away in the heat of battle.

425
00:23:06,360 --> 00:23:07,240
Besides,

426
00:23:07,920 --> 00:23:08,760
in the entire army,

427
00:23:08,760 --> 00:23:10,600
no one has ever captured Di Yunfeng.

428
00:23:12,800 --> 00:23:14,080
Let's go to the fertilizer plant.

429
00:23:14,520 --> 00:23:16,120
And rendezvous with the Wind Rider Battalion's 1st Combat Team.

430
00:23:16,560 --> 00:23:16,960
Yes, sir.

431
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:21,320
Report.

432
00:23:21,480 --> 00:23:23,800
Our remaining 1st Infantry Company was attacked.

433
00:23:23,800 --> 00:23:24,360
But fortunately,

434
00:23:24,360 --> 00:23:26,280
Battalion Commander Jiang arrived in time with the emergency squad,

435
00:23:26,280 --> 00:23:27,680
which prevented further losses.

436
00:23:27,920 --> 00:23:29,640
The casualty report from the Directorate is

437
00:23:29,640 --> 00:23:30,520
forty percent.

438
00:23:30,520 --> 00:23:32,040
Investigate their strike method immediately.

439
00:23:32,560 --> 00:23:33,400
Yes, sir.

440
00:23:40,880 --> 00:23:41,840
Zeng Muhan reporting.

441
00:23:42,120 --> 00:23:43,880
It was the Blue Force special ops assault team.

442
00:23:44,280 --> 00:23:45,960
The Blue Force still has combat capability indeed.

443
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:48,360
Hurry up and locate the Blue Force's latest command post.

444
00:23:48,360 --> 00:23:50,600
Have Zeng Muhan coordinate with Jiang Shengqiang in combat.

445
00:23:50,600 --> 00:23:51,360
Yes, sir.

446
00:23:54,680 --> 00:23:55,720
Yang Maolin reporting.

447
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:57,240
The Blue Force special ops team withdrew immediately after striking.

448
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:58,200
No contact, no confrontation.

449
00:23:58,200 --> 00:23:59,800
They've vanished without a trace now.

450
00:24:01,280 --> 00:24:02,640
They're playing a game of cat and mouse.

451
00:24:02,640 --> 00:24:03,320
Report.

452
00:24:03,320 --> 00:24:04,800
An abnormal signal has been detected.

453
00:24:05,960 --> 00:24:07,600
The frequency of this signal is very low.

454
00:24:07,600 --> 00:24:08,360
So at first,

455
00:24:08,360 --> 00:24:09,680
it didn't catch our attention.

456
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:10,760
But starting today,

457
00:24:10,760 --> 00:24:12,480
it suddenly started appearing frequently.

458
00:24:12,600 --> 00:24:13,480
And the time it appears

459
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:15,320
matches perfectly with the siege of Sea Breeze Pass.

460
00:24:15,640 --> 00:24:16,560
That's why it was captured.

461
00:24:17,280 --> 00:24:18,200
The signal source is located

462
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:19,920
fifteen kilometers off the coast.

463
00:24:19,920 --> 00:24:20,600
Morning Cloud Island.

464
00:24:20,600 --> 00:24:21,360
Investigate.

465
00:24:21,360 --> 00:24:22,240
Yes, sir.

466
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:34,600
Platoon Leader.

467
00:24:35,080 --> 00:24:36,640
We have a clear view ahead. Nothing found.

468
00:24:37,160 --> 00:24:38,840
Based on their tracks,

469
00:24:39,160 --> 00:24:40,440
they could only have gone this way.

470
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:43,160
How could they vanish into thin air?

471
00:24:43,760 --> 00:24:44,240
Platoon Leader!

472
00:24:45,160 --> 00:24:46,320
What do we do now?

473
00:24:48,600 --> 00:24:49,520
Skylark, Skylark.

474
00:24:49,760 --> 00:24:50,760
Do you copy?

475
00:24:51,560 --> 00:24:52,240
Skylark copies.

476
00:24:52,920 --> 00:24:54,120
Any activity in the rear?

477
00:24:55,040 --> 00:24:56,080
All clear in the rear.

478
00:24:56,440 --> 00:24:57,520
All clear in the rear.

479
00:24:58,120 --> 00:25:00,120
Continue searching towards the shallow beach.

480
00:25:06,120 --> 00:25:06,560
Platoon Leader!

481
00:25:08,720 --> 00:25:10,000
Someone intentionally covered their tracks here.

482
00:25:16,000 --> 00:25:17,000
Combat boot prints.

483
00:25:18,360 --> 00:25:20,280
Looks like the Blue Force retreated this way.

484
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:22,480
The tide went out before they left,

485
00:25:23,000 --> 00:25:24,800
which is why they left boot prints behind.

486
00:25:25,760 --> 00:25:26,960
Report to command immediately.

487
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:28,000
Yes, sir.

488
00:25:28,680 --> 00:25:29,240
Report!

489
00:25:29,440 --> 00:25:30,960
Platoon Leader Yang from Special Ops sent a message.

490
00:25:31,160 --> 00:25:32,960
Found traces of the Blue Force retreating by sea.

491
00:25:33,840 --> 00:25:35,400
I've found some clues here too.

492
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:37,800
There's an administrative village on Morning Cloud Island.

493
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:38,840
The villagers there

494
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:40,240
mostly make a living by fishing.

495
00:25:40,640 --> 00:25:41,520
Years ago,

496
00:25:41,520 --> 00:25:42,640
a real estate developer

497
00:25:42,640 --> 00:25:43,680
took over the island

498
00:25:43,680 --> 00:25:45,240
and began large-scale development.

499
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:46,920
It was later found to be illegal construction,

500
00:25:46,920 --> 00:25:48,120
severely lacking proper permits.

501
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:49,080
Many buildings

502
00:25:49,080 --> 00:25:50,880
still haven't been demolished to this day.

503
00:25:52,040 --> 00:25:53,040
What's the status of the buildings?

504
00:25:53,840 --> 00:25:55,080
Most of them are unfinished.

505
00:25:55,080 --> 00:25:56,400
But a few are completed.

506
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:57,800
And the street layout?

507
00:25:57,800 --> 00:25:58,720
It's mostly formed.

508
00:26:03,160 --> 00:26:04,440
On the surface,

509
00:26:05,280 --> 00:26:06,840
this is a highly suitable

510
00:26:06,840 --> 00:26:08,640
natural terrain for urban warfare.

511
00:26:09,880 --> 00:26:11,760
Coupled with the whole island capture plan,

512
00:26:12,120 --> 00:26:12,920
I reckon

513
00:26:14,040 --> 00:26:16,000
this is the Blue Force headquarters we're looking for.

514
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:19,280
But Di Yunfeng was KIA

515
00:26:19,280 --> 00:26:20,400
and is out of the exercise.

516
00:26:21,120 --> 00:26:23,200
If this is the Blue Force command center,

517
00:26:23,840 --> 00:26:25,760
then who exactly is in command?

518
00:26:26,040 --> 00:26:27,200
Could it be Long Yuanshan?

519
00:26:27,840 --> 00:26:28,480
That's right.

520
00:26:28,840 --> 00:26:29,560
It's him.

521
00:26:41,120 --> 00:26:42,840
Brigade Commander Long knows me too well.

522
00:26:43,840 --> 00:26:44,560
So...

523
00:26:45,560 --> 00:26:47,280
I want to make some adjustments to

524
00:26:47,760 --> 00:26:48,640
the remaining command authority.

525
00:26:52,600 --> 00:26:54,520
Don't tell me you want to copy Di Yunfeng.

526
00:27:14,680 --> 00:27:17,400
Zeng Muhan, pass the comms to Battalion Commander Jiang.

527
00:27:17,560 --> 00:27:18,200
Yes, sir.

528
00:27:23,080 --> 00:27:24,000
This is Jiang Shengqiang.

529
00:27:24,280 --> 00:27:25,400
According to the exercise plan,

530
00:27:25,400 --> 00:27:26,320
if the superior commander is KIA,

531
00:27:26,320 --> 00:27:27,920
I assume command.

532
00:27:28,320 --> 00:27:30,160
I order you, starting now,

533
00:27:30,560 --> 00:27:31,480
to make all preparations to take over

534
00:27:31,480 --> 00:27:33,680
military command of Wind Rider Battalion.

535
00:27:34,160 --> 00:27:36,160
Liang Hong will rendezvous with you tonight.

536
00:27:36,640 --> 00:27:38,360
As for my final combat orders,

537
00:27:39,000 --> 00:27:39,960
for security reasons,

538
00:27:39,960 --> 00:27:41,560
she will relay them to you in person.

539
00:27:41,920 --> 00:27:42,800
Your current mission is

540
00:27:43,000 --> 00:27:44,800
to make all preparations to assume your post.

541
00:27:45,120 --> 00:27:45,800
Guo Zijian!

542
00:27:46,680 --> 00:27:47,560
What are you planning?

543
00:27:48,040 --> 00:27:48,680
Old Jiang,

544
00:27:49,640 --> 00:27:51,600
Wind Rider Battalion is temporarily in your hands.

545
00:28:05,760 --> 00:28:06,480
We're just two kilometers

546
00:28:06,480 --> 00:28:07,360
away from the estuary.

547
00:28:08,800 --> 00:28:09,680
I didn't expect Battalion Commander Guo

548
00:28:09,680 --> 00:28:11,520
to hand over the final command to you.

549
00:28:12,760 --> 00:28:13,720
He trusts us,

550
00:28:15,840 --> 00:28:17,640
so we can't betray his trust.

551
00:28:27,240 --> 00:28:28,160
Reporting, Vice Captain!

552
00:28:28,240 --> 00:28:29,680
All units of our special ops team

553
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:31,480
have landed on the island from various points.

554
00:28:31,480 --> 00:28:32,880
The Captain ordered us to move out right away.

555
00:28:33,920 --> 00:28:34,320
Copy that.

556
00:28:34,760 --> 00:28:36,080
Move out to Morning Cloud Island immediately.

557
00:28:37,880 --> 00:28:39,240
Three vehicles are heading our way.

558
00:28:43,040 --> 00:28:44,240
Take cover and prepare to strike.

559
00:28:44,440 --> 00:28:44,840
Yes, sir!

560
00:29:03,120 --> 00:29:04,200
We've been intercepted.

561
00:29:05,120 --> 00:29:05,800
Leave this to me.

562
00:29:05,800 --> 00:29:06,840
I'll cover your retreat.

563
00:29:45,480 --> 00:29:46,840
Cover!

564
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:48,680
Yes, sir!

565
00:30:12,680 --> 00:30:13,800
Order the special ops team

566
00:30:13,800 --> 00:30:16,120
to make all preparations for the amphibious island assault.

567
00:30:16,520 --> 00:30:18,560
Order the transport helicopter formation

568
00:30:18,560 --> 00:30:20,200
to be ready to take off for combat at any time.

569
00:30:20,560 --> 00:30:22,800
Order the drone formation to coordinate closely

570
00:30:22,800 --> 00:30:24,200
to ensure precise strikes.

571
00:30:24,640 --> 00:30:25,160
Order

572
00:30:25,160 --> 00:30:26,600
the electronic warfare detachment

573
00:30:27,240 --> 00:30:29,120
not to miss any suspicious information.

574
00:30:29,120 --> 00:30:29,760
At the same time,

575
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:32,000
once precise coordinates are sent back from the frontline,

576
00:30:32,520 --> 00:30:34,000
use the plug-and-play mode

577
00:30:34,000 --> 00:30:36,200
to coordinate naval and air forces for follow-up strikes.

578
00:30:36,320 --> 00:30:37,160
Understood.

579
00:30:41,040 --> 00:30:42,160
You're already KIA.

580
00:30:47,320 --> 00:30:48,040
That's right.

581
00:30:49,440 --> 00:30:50,720
But going out like this

582
00:30:52,000 --> 00:30:52,440
is worth it.

583
00:30:53,120 --> 00:30:53,880
Evacuate immediately.

584
00:30:54,520 --> 00:30:54,960
Move!

585
00:31:06,320 --> 00:31:08,080
I want to know why it's Jiang Shengqiang.

586
00:31:08,720 --> 00:31:10,480
Is this also part of your plan?

587
00:31:11,280 --> 00:31:11,880
First,

588
00:31:12,480 --> 00:31:14,040
as the commander of the Hurricane Battalion,

589
00:31:14,320 --> 00:31:15,960
Jiang Shengqiang is fully capable of this.

590
00:31:16,240 --> 00:31:16,960
Second,

591
00:31:17,400 --> 00:31:19,040
Long Yuanshan knows me too well.

592
00:31:19,440 --> 00:31:21,240
And Jiang Shengqiang's combat style

593
00:31:21,440 --> 00:31:22,480
is completely different from mine.

594
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:23,520
Changing formation at the last minute

595
00:31:23,600 --> 00:31:25,800
will help disrupt Long Yuanshan's decision-making.

596
00:31:26,080 --> 00:31:26,680
Third,

597
00:31:27,400 --> 00:31:28,680
the enemy situation at the front is highly complex,

598
00:31:29,160 --> 00:31:30,440
and drawing to a close.

599
00:31:30,840 --> 00:31:32,200
I need to command from the front.

600
00:31:32,520 --> 00:31:33,040
Fourth,

601
00:31:33,480 --> 00:31:34,520
as an old rival,

602
00:31:34,960 --> 00:31:36,960
Jiang Shengqiang understands my combat intentions perfectly.

603
00:31:37,240 --> 00:31:38,400
With your cooperation,

604
00:31:38,640 --> 00:31:39,920
we can guarantee success.

605
00:31:40,880 --> 00:31:41,920
Are you satisfied with the answer?

606
00:31:45,480 --> 00:31:46,160
Staff Officer Hu!

607
00:31:46,360 --> 00:31:46,720
Here, sir!

608
00:31:46,720 --> 00:31:47,400
Gear up.

609
00:31:47,640 --> 00:31:48,360
Yes, sir!

610
00:31:50,200 --> 00:31:52,360
No, there's one thing you left out.

611
00:31:53,200 --> 00:31:54,520
You're itching for some action yourself.

612
00:31:56,560 --> 00:31:57,360
I admit it,

613
00:31:57,800 --> 00:31:59,680
but it's only after comprehensive consideration

614
00:31:59,680 --> 00:32:00,360
that I made this decision.

615
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:02,400
It's not just for my own thrill.

616
00:32:21,760 --> 00:32:23,680
The weather is terrible tonight.

617
00:32:23,680 --> 00:32:25,960
The waves are rough. Stay safe.

618
00:32:27,120 --> 00:32:27,840
Don't worry.

619
00:32:28,680 --> 00:32:29,600
I'll be careful.

620
00:33:14,520 --> 00:33:16,160
Getting restless, Commander?

621
00:33:16,280 --> 00:33:18,400
What did I tell you? Nothing beats the front lines.

622
00:33:19,280 --> 00:33:20,720
Today we're going to have a blast.

623
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:22,200
Roger that.

624
00:33:23,040 --> 00:33:23,640
Sir!

625
00:33:23,880 --> 00:33:25,600
Five kilometers from Morning Cloud Island.

626
00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:26,920
Stick to the original plan.

627
00:33:27,200 --> 00:33:28,680
Continue flying toward Dawn Island.

628
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:30,360
Yes, sir.

629
00:33:41,440 --> 00:33:42,200
Brigade Commander Long,

630
00:33:42,200 --> 00:33:43,600
radar has detected three helicopters

631
00:33:43,600 --> 00:33:44,960
heading towards Dawn Island.

632
00:33:45,160 --> 00:33:46,280
Understood. Monitor them closely.

633
00:33:46,280 --> 00:33:46,840
Yes, sir.

634
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:56,680
Battalion Commander,

635
00:33:57,320 --> 00:33:59,000
we are five kilometers past Morning Cloud Island.

636
00:34:00,040 --> 00:34:00,840
Everyone,

637
00:34:01,200 --> 00:34:03,320
check your gear. Prepare for insertion.

638
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:12,920
Pilots, attention.

639
00:34:13,320 --> 00:34:16,000
After completing the routine recon of Dawn Island,

640
00:34:16,080 --> 00:34:17,000
you are to proceed

641
00:34:17,280 --> 00:34:19,440
with the recon of Morning Cloud Island.

642
00:34:19,680 --> 00:34:20,800
You may use flares,

643
00:34:20,800 --> 00:34:22,080
but do not get too close.

644
00:34:22,960 --> 00:34:23,320
Copy that.

645
00:34:27,120 --> 00:34:28,600
One minute to water jump.

646
00:34:31,600 --> 00:34:32,200
Stand up!

647
00:35:06,520 --> 00:35:07,240
Yang Maolin

648
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:07,640
Here!

649
00:35:07,640 --> 00:35:08,800
Personnel status?

650
00:35:09,200 --> 00:35:11,200
Headcount complete. All present.

651
00:35:12,480 --> 00:35:13,360
Comrades.

652
00:35:14,400 --> 00:35:17,600
The outcome of this battle depends on us.

653
00:35:18,160 --> 00:35:19,360
Are you confident?

654
00:35:19,360 --> 00:35:20,480
Yes!

655
00:35:20,480 --> 00:35:21,040
Good.

656
00:35:21,920 --> 00:35:24,880
The Blue Force command post on Morning Cloud Island

657
00:35:24,920 --> 00:35:25,880
is only two kilometers away.

658
00:35:26,240 --> 00:35:27,200
Can you make it?

659
00:35:27,480 --> 00:35:28,320
We can!

660
00:35:28,320 --> 00:35:29,400
Don't worry, Battalion Commander.

661
00:35:29,880 --> 00:35:30,960
This distance is no problem.

662
00:35:31,000 --> 00:35:31,720
Good.

663
00:35:32,840 --> 00:35:33,880
Expect wind and waves tonight.

664
00:35:34,320 --> 00:35:35,280
Maintain formation.

665
00:35:35,440 --> 00:35:36,400
If anyone can't make it,

666
00:35:36,720 --> 00:35:37,520
speak up immediately.

667
00:35:37,960 --> 00:35:39,040
No, sir!

668
00:35:39,440 --> 00:35:40,040
Move out!

669
00:35:40,280 --> 00:35:41,000
Yes, sir!

670
00:35:56,040 --> 00:35:56,520
Report.

671
00:35:56,840 --> 00:35:57,520
Recon reports show that

672
00:35:57,520 --> 00:36:00,080
after finishing their search of Dawn Island,

673
00:36:00,080 --> 00:36:01,600
three helicopters are heading to Morning Cloud Island.

674
00:36:01,960 --> 00:36:04,280
Even though their aerial recon is just a quick sweep,

675
00:36:04,680 --> 00:36:06,720
we must maintain air defense to prevent any surprises.

676
00:36:06,720 --> 00:36:07,280
Yes, sir.

677
00:36:16,360 --> 00:36:18,040
Link up with all strike assets.

678
00:36:18,760 --> 00:36:20,120
As soon as they send the coordinates,

679
00:36:20,360 --> 00:36:21,440
initiate the strike immediately.

680
00:36:25,320 --> 00:36:26,160
Link established.

681
00:36:26,160 --> 00:36:27,400
Ready to strike at any time.

682
00:36:53,120 --> 00:36:54,080
Yang Maolin. Lin Yihu.

683
00:36:54,080 --> 00:36:54,600
Here!

684
00:36:54,760 --> 00:36:55,000
Here!

685
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:55,920
In a moment, you two

686
00:36:56,360 --> 00:36:57,560
will land on my left and right flanks.

687
00:36:57,560 --> 00:36:58,880
Listen up. Once you land,

688
00:36:59,560 --> 00:37:01,640
you must scout the Blue Force's coastal defenses.

689
00:37:02,120 --> 00:37:02,400
Yes, sir!

690
00:37:02,920 --> 00:37:03,480
Lin Yihu.

691
00:37:03,760 --> 00:37:04,760
Your main task

692
00:37:04,760 --> 00:37:06,760
is to gather and compile information,

693
00:37:06,760 --> 00:37:08,000
and send it to command.

694
00:37:08,200 --> 00:37:08,880
Commander!

695
00:37:09,240 --> 00:37:10,000
Me?

696
00:37:10,000 --> 00:37:10,560
Yes.

697
00:37:11,160 --> 00:37:12,120
Once the firefight starts,

698
00:37:12,280 --> 00:37:13,560
no matter how Yang Maolin and I fight,

699
00:37:13,760 --> 00:37:14,480
you must stay calm.

700
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:16,240
Your primary mission

701
00:37:16,640 --> 00:37:18,760
is to send the target coordinates to command.

702
00:37:18,760 --> 00:37:19,600
Got it?

703
00:37:20,520 --> 00:37:21,280
Understood!

704
00:37:21,520 --> 00:37:23,160
You're a special ops soldier who's seen blood.

705
00:37:23,800 --> 00:37:24,600
Don't embarrass us.

706
00:37:25,560 --> 00:37:26,320
Commander,

707
00:37:26,520 --> 00:37:28,160
I was just excited.

708
00:37:28,600 --> 00:37:32,280
Golden Right Foot poured his heart into this equipment too.

709
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:35,960
Let's hope Wu Dongsheng blesses you with success.

710
00:37:36,440 --> 00:37:37,000
Don't worry, Commander.

711
00:37:37,000 --> 00:37:38,200
I won't let him down.

712
00:37:40,320 --> 00:37:40,920
Dongfang.

713
00:37:40,920 --> 00:37:41,320
Here!

714
00:37:41,320 --> 00:37:42,880
Did you bring enough micro drones?

715
00:37:43,760 --> 00:37:45,280
Don't worry, Commander. I brought plenty.

716
00:37:45,520 --> 00:37:45,800
Good.

717
00:37:46,600 --> 00:37:47,160
Everyone,

718
00:37:47,920 --> 00:37:48,400
move out!

719
00:37:48,480 --> 00:37:49,480
Yes, sir!

720
00:37:55,600 --> 00:37:56,440
Brigade Commander Long.

721
00:37:57,320 --> 00:37:59,640
We still haven't found their command post.

722
00:38:00,320 --> 00:38:01,360
They're quite cunning.

723
00:38:01,720 --> 00:38:02,800
That surprise attack this evening...

724
00:38:02,800 --> 00:38:03,520
Even though we took out

725
00:38:03,520 --> 00:38:05,320
a small portion of their infantry,

726
00:38:05,760 --> 00:38:07,440
他们的 new combat forces

727
00:38:07,760 --> 00:38:08,520
aren't easy to track down.

728
00:38:09,600 --> 00:38:12,760
The report just said the Red Force sent three helicopters.

729
00:38:12,880 --> 00:38:14,840
Right. They flew a lap and went back.

730
00:38:15,600 --> 00:38:16,080
Immediately pull up

731
00:38:16,080 --> 00:38:17,720
the radar images of those three helicopters.

732
00:38:17,720 --> 00:38:18,360
Yes, sir.

733
00:38:24,520 --> 00:38:26,040
These are three transport helicopters.

734
00:38:26,640 --> 00:38:27,320
Right.

735
00:38:27,680 --> 00:38:29,280
Their attack helicopters have already been shot down.

736
00:38:30,560 --> 00:38:32,480
So they simply decided

737
00:38:32,480 --> 00:38:34,560
to beat us at our own game and slip right past us.

738
00:38:35,120 --> 00:38:36,000
Wu Dazhou.

739
00:38:37,240 --> 00:38:38,480
They're already here.

740
00:39:10,880 --> 00:39:11,440
Order.

741
00:39:12,800 --> 00:39:14,240
Launch the attack drones.

742
00:39:14,360 --> 00:39:16,080
Target: Morning Cloud Island.

743
00:39:16,280 --> 00:39:18,160
Yes, sir. Launch the attack drones.

744
00:39:18,160 --> 00:39:19,360
Target: Morning Cloud Island.

745
00:39:19,360 --> 00:39:21,320
Report. Targets not yet acquired.

746
00:39:21,520 --> 00:39:23,120
Unable to conduct a precision strike.

747
00:39:27,880 --> 00:39:28,760
Guo Zijian,

748
00:39:29,440 --> 00:39:31,000
I need your coordinates.

749
00:39:34,360 --> 00:39:36,160
Red Force traces spotted on the beach.

750
00:39:36,160 --> 00:39:36,920
That fast?

751
00:39:39,240 --> 00:39:41,120
Even if they successfully crossed the sea,

752
00:39:42,000 --> 00:39:43,160
they don't have many troops left.

753
00:39:43,640 --> 00:39:44,520
I did the math.

754
00:39:44,520 --> 00:39:47,000
Besides some technical units under his command,

755
00:39:47,400 --> 00:39:49,120
Guo Zijian has a special ops platoon left at most.

756
00:39:49,400 --> 00:39:51,800
The rest of his forces are incapable of close combat.

757
00:39:52,680 --> 00:39:53,840
On my end,

758
00:39:54,040 --> 00:39:55,760
I still have half a special ops battalion.

759
00:39:55,760 --> 00:39:56,680
That's more than enough.

760
00:39:57,520 --> 00:39:59,080
We have the home-field advantage here.

761
00:39:59,080 --> 00:40:01,160
We just need to tightly blockade his support forces.

762
00:40:01,160 --> 00:40:02,000
Rest assured.

763
00:40:02,360 --> 00:40:04,480
With his few dozen men in this area,

764
00:40:04,600 --> 00:40:05,680
we can simply trap them to death.

765
00:40:05,680 --> 00:40:06,360
Go.

766
00:40:06,560 --> 00:40:07,320
Yes, sir.

767
00:40:09,800 --> 00:40:10,360
Staff Officer Zhu.

768
00:40:10,360 --> 00:40:10,920
Here.

769
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:13,120
Order my final reserve of

770
00:40:13,120 --> 00:40:14,160
ultra-long-range strike forces

771
00:40:14,280 --> 00:40:15,280
to target

772
00:40:15,280 --> 00:40:17,640
any potential Red Force naval support.

773
00:40:18,160 --> 00:40:19,640
Whether it's ships or combat vehicles,

774
00:40:19,640 --> 00:40:21,280
anything that comes within five kilometers of Morning Cloud Island...

775
00:40:21,360 --> 00:40:22,240
Destroy it all.

776
00:40:22,440 --> 00:40:23,120
Yes, sir.

777
00:40:28,560 --> 00:40:29,840
Guo Zijian.

778
00:40:30,640 --> 00:40:31,280
This place

779
00:40:32,040 --> 00:40:33,880
will be your graveyard.

780
00:40:36,280 --> 00:40:37,400
Attention, Honey Badger.

781
00:40:37,800 --> 00:40:40,080
At the critical moment, even if it means sacrificing yourself,

782
00:40:40,600 --> 00:40:42,040
you must protect Siberian Tiger.

783
00:40:42,760 --> 00:40:43,800
Honey Badger copies.

784
00:40:51,400 --> 00:40:52,560
Attention, Siberian Tiger.

785
00:40:52,840 --> 00:40:54,000
Once engaged in combat,

786
00:40:54,200 --> 00:40:55,600
the targets will appear one after another.

787
00:40:56,000 --> 00:40:58,560
Focus on collecting and transmitting coordinates.

788
00:40:58,920 --> 00:41:00,120
Siberian Tiger copies.

789
00:41:01,720 --> 00:41:03,040
Attention, all teams.

790
00:41:03,280 --> 00:41:05,600
Maintain distance and support each other.

791
00:41:05,920 --> 00:41:06,480
Copy that.

792
00:41:07,360 --> 00:41:08,120
Move out!

793
00:41:23,280 --> 00:41:24,000
Report.

794
00:41:24,920 --> 00:41:25,400
Go ahead.

795
00:41:25,680 --> 00:41:27,920
Naval, air, and long-range fire support are in position.

796
00:41:27,920 --> 00:41:29,760
Ready to strike once targets are provided.

797
00:41:35,840 --> 00:41:36,440
Wait a little longer.

798
00:41:36,440 --> 00:41:36,960
Yes, sir.

799
00:42:47,800 --> 00:42:48,720
Are the coordinates set?

800
00:42:48,800 --> 00:42:50,120
Target Three confirmed.

801
00:42:50,200 --> 00:42:51,200
Moving to Target Four.

802
00:42:51,320 --> 00:42:51,800
Let's move.
